# shell: tracker
# TS-044/PVL-051: the count view keeps the bottom-left and the horizontal
# scroll bar shares its row; the stepper arrows step half a line, and the
# columns slide under the strip as the bar moves.
wait 8
note widen the content past the window with three more columns
click 150 36
wait 3
menu-pick Location
wait 3
click 150 36
wait 3
menu-pick Permissions
wait 3
click 150 36
wait 3
menu-pick Original path
wait 3
note the Kind heading's K sits at 283,81 before any scroll
expect-pixel 283 81 010101
note three clicks of the right stepper slide the columns left
click 732 504
wait 2
click 732 504
wait 2
click 732 504
wait 3
expect-pixel 283 81 d8d8d8
note and the left stepper walks back
click 141 504
wait 2
click 141 504
wait 2
click 141 504
wait 3
expect-pixel 283 81 010101
quit
